 "remarks": "WELCOME TO 1940 REIMAGINED!! A TOTAL RENOVATION WITH ATTENTION TO EVERY DETAIL. SET ON 2.3 PRIVATE LEVEL ACRES WITH POOL, LANDSCAPING & PATIOS FOR AN OUTDOOR OASIS FOR ENTERTAINING & FAMILY FUN! THIS STONE FRONT COLONIAL FARM HOUSE BLENDS THE CHARM OF 1940 WITH THE AMENITIES OF 2026. THE FIRST FLOOR LAYOUT IS DESIGNED FOR FAMILY LIVING & FABULOUS ENTERTAINING. CHEF'S KITCHEN, PANELLED DINING ROOM, FAMILY ROOM WITH FPL & FRENCH DOORS TO SUNROOM, BR/OFFICE WITH FULL BATH & STUDY. GRAND STAIRCASE LEADS TO UPPER LEVEL FEATURING 2 BEDROOMS, FULL BATH AND PRIMARY SUITE WITH FULL BATH & CUSTOM CLOSET. MOVE RIGHT IN & BE READY TO CELEBRATE YOUR HOLIDAYS IN STYLE!",
